OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after fire at former
OL,4,Anightclub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Farson following a fire at a former
OL,8,Fnightclub.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to King
OL,11,FStreet in Wigan at about 03:10 BST,
OL,12,Fwith three fire engines from Bolton and
OL,13,FAtherton sent to the scene.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for Greater Manchester
OL,16,FFire and Rescue Service said that while
OL,17,Ffirefighters had now extinguished the
OL,18,Ffire, they remained at the building to
OL,19,Fcheck for any lingering hot spots.
